{"rank": 418, "article": "The Love Hypothesis", "revid": 1061458444, "parentid": 0, "user": "Significa liberdade", "timestamp": "2021-12-21T20:57:18Z", "comment": "[[WP:AES|←]]Created page with '{{short description|2021 romance novel by Ali Hazelwood}}  '''''The Love Hypothesis''''' is a romance novel by [[Ali Hazelwood]], published September 14, 2021 by [[Berkley Books]].  == Reception == ''The Love Hypothesis'' received a starred review from ''[[Library Journal]]''<ref>{{Cite web|last=Miller|first=Heather|title=The Love Hypothesis|url=https://www.libraryjournal.com/review/the-love-hypothesis-1783029|url-status=live|access-date=2021-12-21|website=...'", "tags": ["visualeditor"], "size": 2174}
